{"message":"Based on the currently documented offers, the clearest sign-up bonus is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 as a statement or checking-account credit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. The account must be new, open, and in good standing; returns, fees, balance transfers, and cash-equivalent transactions do not count.

If you expect substantial spending, the Silver Zoom Card may provide more value through a 3x cash-back promotion for nine months from account opening, with claims available through December 31, 2025. However, it is a multiplier rather than a fixed sign-up bonus, so its value depends on your spending and the eligible offer appearing in your portal.

For a straightforward cash-back bonus, the previously documented Silver Rewards Card offer was $500 after $2,000 in one month, but its June 30, 2025 application deadline has passed and it is no longer current. Also, the EcoCard is the only true points-based card; Rho-Bank cash-back rewards are represented as points internally but redeem at 1 point = $0.01."}
